-burning-drug-reclassify","line":22},{"title":"Maurice Tainter and Windsor Cutting","target":"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1558869/?page=1","line":30},{"title":"many side effects","target":"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1315023/?page=1","line":34},{"title":"W F Loomis and Fritz Lipmann","target":"http://www.jbc.org/content/173/2/807.full.pdf+html","line":38},{"title":"Nicholas Bachynsky","target":"http://www.quackwatch.org/02ConsumerProtection/FDAActions/bachynsky.html","line":42},{"title":"Legal action","target":"http://www.quackwatch.org/01QuackeryRelatedTopics/Cancer/icht.html","line":44},{"title":"Dan Duchaine","target":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dan_Duchaine","line":48},{"title":"deaths","target":"http://www.independent.co.uk/news/uk/home-news/death-of-medical-student-sarah-houston-after-taking-banned-slimming-drug-dinitrophenol-highlights-dangers-of-buying-pills-online-warns-government-8584597.html","line":50},{"title":"internet","target":"http://www.nhs.uk/news/2014/01January/Pages/New-warnings-issued-over-deadly-DNP-diet-drug.aspx","line":50}],"metadata":{"title":"DNP: the return of a deadly weight-loss drug | Philip Strange","source":"https://www.theguardian.com/science/the-h-word/2014/feb/06/dnp-deadly-weight-loss-drug-science-history","author":[],"published":"2014-02-06","created":"2025-04-28","description":"<b>Philip Strange:</b> How could achemical used a century ago in explosives come to be used by bodybuilders tolose weight?  The story of dinitrophenol illustratesthe fatal allure of slimming drugs","tags":null},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"xhpl5k","at":1778088457664},"key":"Clippings/DNP the return of a deadly weight-loss drug  Philip Strange.md"},
